creatures:
- name: Cloud Giant
  statblock:
    custom_statblock: |
      **Armor Class** 14  
      **Hit Points** 200 (rollable(dice=16d12 + 96,dicelabel=Hit Points))  
      **Speed** Walk 40 ft., Fly 20 ft. (hover)  
      **Initiative:** rollable(dice=1d20+4,label=+4,dicelabel=Initiative) (14)

      ---

      |||Mod|Save|||Mod|Save|
      |---:|:---:|:---:|:---:|---:|:---:|:---:|:---:|
      |Str:|number(name=str,label=Strength,value=27)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=str,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Strength Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+8,label=+8,dicelabel=Strength Saving Throw)|Int:|number(name=int,label=Intelligence,value=12)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=int,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Intelligence Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+1,label=+1,dicelabel=Intelligence Saving Throw)|
      |Dex:|number(name=dex,label=Dexterity,value=10)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=dex,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Dexterity Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+0,label=+0,dicelabel=Dexterity Saving Throw)|Wis:|number(name=wis,label=Wisdom,value=16)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=wis,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Wisdom Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+7,label=+7,dicelabel=Wisdom Saving Throw)|
      |Con:|number(name=con,label=Constitution,value=22)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=con,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Constitution Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+10,label=+10,dicelabel=Constitution Saving Throw)|Cha:|number(name=cha,label=Charisma,value=16)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=cha,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Charisma Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+3,label=+3,dicelabel=Charisma Saving Throw)|

      ---

      **Skills** Insight rollable(dice=1d20+7,label=+7,dicelabel=Insight Check), Perception rollable(dice=1d20+11,label=+11,dicelabel=Perception Check)  
      **Senses** Passive Perception 21  
      **Languages** Common, Giant  
      **Challenge** 9 (5,000 XP)  
      **Proficiency Bonus** +4  

      ## Actions

      ***Multiattack.*** The giant makes two attacks, using Thunderous Mace or Thundercloud in any combination. It can replace one attack with a use of Spellcasting to cast [Fog Cloud](https://www.dndbeyond.com/spells/2618910-fog-cloud).

      ***Thunderous Mace.*** *Melee Attack Roll* rollable(dice=1d20+12,label=+12,dicelabel=To Hit [Thunderous Mace]), reach 10 ft. *Hit:* rollable(dice=3d8+8,dicelabel=Damage [Thunderous Mace]) Bludgeoning damage plus rollable(dice=2d6,dicelabel=Damage [Thunderous Mace]) Thunder damage.

      ***Thundercloud.*** *Ranged Attack Roll* rollable(dice=1d20+12,label=+12,dicelabel=To Hit [Thundercloud]), range 240 ft. *Hit:* rollable(dice=3d6+8,dicelabel=Damage [Thundercloud]) Thunder damage, and the target has the ***Incapacitated*** condition until the end of its next turn.

      ***Spellcasting.*** The giant casts one of the following spells, requiring no Material components and using Charisma as the spellcasting ability (spell save DC 15):

      At will: [Detect Magic](https://www.dndbeyond.com/spells/2619097-detect-magic), [Fog Cloud](https://www.dndbeyond.com/spells/2618910-fog-cloud), [Light](https://www.dndbeyond.com/spells/2618996-light)  
      1/day each: [Control Weather](https://www.dndbeyond.com/spells/2619054-control-weather), [Gaseous Form](https://www.dndbeyond.com/spells/2618927-gaseous-form), [Telekinesis](https://www.dndbeyond.com/spells/2619157-telekinesis)  

      ***Misty Step.*** The giant casts the [Misty Step](https://www.dndbeyond.com/spells/2619133-misty-step) spell, using the same spellcasting ability as Spellcasting.

      At will: [Misty Step](https://www.dndbeyond.com/spells/2619133-misty-step)  

    type: custom
  blurb: |
    # $[objectname]

    *Huge Giant, Neutral*  
    **Challenge** 9
  subtype: npc
  id: srd2024cloudgiant
  status: 1

